        <object id="p3_correct" label="Correct source records" description="The source-data owner investigates the logged issues and corrects verified errors in the originating process. The full reporting cycle then re-extracts and revalidates the updated data. This is a proposed human workflow, not a claim that correction tracking is implemented in the database." role="Source-data owner / tax operations" system="Source systems and correction workflow (conceptual)" inputs="Correction request&#10;Underlying declarations and assessments&#10;Supporting evidence" outputs="Updated source records&#10;Correction completion note" added="true" kind="function" model_id="p3_correct" phase="Prepare and validate source data" original_label="Correct source records" tooltip="Correct source records&#10;&#10;The source-data owner investigates the logged issues and corrects verified errors in the originating process. The full reporting cycle then re-extracts and revalidates the updated data. This is a proposed human workflow, not a claim that correction tracking is implemented in the database.&#10;&#10;Role: Source-data owner / tax operations&#10;&#10;Application: Source systems and correction workflow (conceptual)&#10;&#10;Inputs: Correction request; Underlying declarations and assessments; Supporting evidence&#10;&#10;Outputs: Updated source records; Correction completion note">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="flow" style="html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=16;fontColor=#243d4a;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=2;fillColor=#edf7ee;strokeColor=#2163c4;strokeWidth=2.3;shadow=0;shape=rectangle;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;perimeter=rectanglePerimeter;">
